ນັ້ນແມ່ນຄວາມຊ່ຽວຊານຂອງຂ້າພະເຈົ້າ.

468
00:52:33,000 --> 00:52:39,000
"Dragon" DeBlois/Sanders Final Draft 02-13-2010 73. Stoick hits his hammer against the iron enclosure, rattling the arena with a terrible reverberating clatter. scareed, the Nightmare snaps at Hiccup's
