ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນຄວາມຄິດມີຮູບຮ່າງໃນໃບຫນ້າຂອງລາວ. ຕາຂອງເຂົາ flashes. Hiccup ເບິ່ງ, ການຮັບຮູ້. Stoic stompes ເຂົ້າໄປໃນປະຕູ.

516
00:57:48,000 --> 00:57:50,000
troll!

517
00:57:53,000 --> 00:57:59,000
Bride of Grendel! The Red Death discharges a spray of fire at the twins. they barely dodge it. Fishlegs ແລະ Snotlout hang behind its eyes, banging off at their shields, making a racket. The Red death opens all of
its SIX eyes, spotting them. The red death unleashes a splash of fire on the twinners. the Red Death unleases a sprayer of fire upon the twinkles. they scarcely elude it. fishlegs and snotlout hung behind his eyes

